at in the center of the board. Capturing it with R: e8-e5 wins material cleanly - gaining a knight without any compensation for White. This is a straightforward tactical win that significantly improves Black's position. After this capture, Black would be up a full knight, which should be enough to win the game with proper technique.\n\n**Answer:** R: e8-e5"}
